{
  "title": "Kissed Smoky Ukrainian Paprika Chicken Skillet",
  "description": "A fresh and light Ukrainian dish featuring paprika, perfect for a midnight craving, made with low-fat ingredients and cooked in a tava-griddle.",
  "cuisine": "Ukrainian",
  "diet": [
    "low-fat"
